    "body": "no no it seems my aws module is not loading (noticed that when rolling back to version 1.3.0)\r\nupon investigating, i discovered the aws module page expects creds or a credential helper in order to load this info.\r\n\r\nhowever my aws settings rely upon sso login so therefore do not show.\r\nhere is a screenshot of with v 1.4.0 and v 1.3.0 (no changes to config file)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/388653/157423311-d968043f-1f9c-4947-8639-ade81547eed6.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nSo it looks like new version does not like aws settings that use sso (despite AWS vars set as below:\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/388653/157423790-6a1985d3-79cc-477e-a0f7-773d4492bfe4.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nDunno why aws module got broken (k8s as git module apper to work as you can see)",
